OL,3,AWomen pose as men to buy testosterone
OL,4,Aonline after prescription difficulties
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen are posing as men to buy
OL,7,Ftestosterone from online pharmacies
OL,8,Fbecause of difficulties getting NHS
OL,9,Fprescriptions in Wales, according to a
OL,10,Fconsultant.
OL,12,FThere has been a "very sharp increase"
OL,13,Fin testosterone referrals to the NHS
OL,14,Ffor post-menopausal women, but access
OL,15,Fvaries between health boards.
OL,17,FMenopause specialist Dr Michelle Olver
OL,18,Fsaid she had seen women with up to 12
OL,19,Ftimes the safe level of the hormone -
OL,20,Frisking permanent side effects -
OL,21,Fbecause they have bought online.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
